                <div style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                    <h3 style="color: #2d3748; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Understanding Mecanum Wheels</h3>
                    <p style="color: #4a5568; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
                        The miniAuto uses Mecanum wheels that allow omnidirectional movement. Each wheel has rollers 
                        at 45° angles that enable the robot to move forward, backward, sideways, and rotate without changing orientation.
                    </p>
                    
                    <div style="background: #edf2f7; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
